      "body": "## Motivation\n\nOn the MLX backend, one call to `/update_weights_from_disk` stops the server.\n\n`MlxModelRunnerStub` keeps the base Torch `WeightUpdater`, whose `get_model` returns the stub's `_DummyModel`. The first thing `update_weights_from_disk` does is walk `model.modules()`:\n\n```\nAttributeError: '_DummyModel' object has no attribute 'modules'\n```\n\nThis is raised inside the scheduler's request dispatch, which doesn't catch it, so the scheduler process exits. The other update paths (`update_weights_from_tensor`, `begin_weight_update`, distributed, IPC) also go through the Torch model. Even if they didn't crash, they would update Torch weights that don't exist, while the served weights live in the MLX model.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- The stub overrides `init_weight_updater` with a small `_MlxWeightUpdater`. Every update entry point returns `(False, \"Online weight updates are not supported on the MLX backend\")`. `begin_weight_update`/`end_weight_update` are no-ops, so a tensor or distributed session fails at the load step with that message.\n- Add a regression test to `test_mlx_runner_pool_contract.py`, next to the other stub-override checks.\n\nActually reloading weights through the MLX runner would be a separate feature.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nApple M2 Max:\n\n- The new test fails on `main` with the `AttributeError` above and passes with this change.\n- `SGLANG_USE_MLX=1 pytest test/registered/unit/hardware_backend/mlx`: 227 passed.\n\nI reproduced the crash at the updater level in the unit test rather than against a running MLX server.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format checks (ruff, isort, codespell on the changed files).\n- [x] Add unit tests.\n- [x] Documentation: not applicable.\n- [x] Follow SGLang code style.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40514725674](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40514725674)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40514725453](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40514725453)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40514725573](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40514725573)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
