    {
      "body": "Hi @yeahdongcn, this is a companion to #46848 in the same stub: `/update_weights_from_disk` on MLX currently crashes the scheduler, and this makes weight updates return an error instead. Could you take a look and start CI with `/tag-and-rerun-ci` when you have time? Thanks!\n\n麻烦帮忙 review 一下 🙏",
      "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:10:44Z",
